      "sourceTextSha256": "73930ace4aecf64352a6f93f9f84c49815eacbe54e05cd30749625df7b0dbdd6",
      "text": "Day 6 · Travel to Monteverde the scenic way, by taxi-boat-taxi: a boat ride across peaceful Lake Arenal, with views of the volcano, to the small town of Río Chiquito, then on by road. Monteverde has a rural, small-town feel, and Santa Elena is its eco-tourism hub. In the heart of the Monteverde Cloud Forest, Selvatura’s zip lines and hanging bridges take you deep into the primary cloud forest. Overnight at Hotel Montaña Monteverde. (B)",
